{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-work-wp-portfolio-slug-jsx","path":"/work/northstone/","result":{"data":{"wpPortfolio":{"title":"NORTHSTONE","content":"<p>During February and March of 2020, I worked extensively with Peel L&amp;P on an indulgent website for a new property development. I was responsible for building a whole range of animations from flying birds and growing plants to paintbrush-style colouring of images. However, the main work was focused on developing an interactive map of the development. The map features animated houses which can be clicked to discover more and filtered using a menu, while data was pulled in from an Umbraco database. The map also features a car which I animated to drive around the various roads and cul-de-sacs.</p>\n","slug":"northstone","url":{"url":"https://www.northstone.co.uk/schemes/silkash/"},"image1":{"image1":{"mediaDetails":{"sizes":[{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/northstone1-300x188.png","width":"300","name":"medium"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/northstone1-1024x640.png","width":"1024","name":"large"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/northstone1-150x150.png","width":"150","name":"thumbnail"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/northstone1-768x480.png","width":"768","name":"medium_large"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/northstone1-1200x750.png","width":"1200","name":"post-thumbnail"}]}}},"image2":{"image2":{"mediaDetails":{"sizes":[{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/northstone2-300x188.png","width":"300","name":"medium"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/northstone2-1024x640.png","width":"1024","name":"large"},{"sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uplo